            <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                id="cd31f598-995a-470d-936f-f7d2f2d8be3a" name="[SF4.3] Select control mode"
                description="&lt;p dir=&quot;LTR&quot;>&lt;span lang=&quot;EN&quot;>The drone pilot can always select control mode and override automatic flight plan mode with the &amp;quot;Pilot control mode&amp;quot; and&amp;quot;manual override&amp;quot;&amp;nbsp;signal. Then, the function interrupts the flight plan with the &amp;quot;flight plan interruption&amp;quot;. &lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&amp;quot;Manual override&amp;quot; signal has been added in V4.3.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p dir=&quot;LTR&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xA;">
              <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                  id="e027803f-5366-4da3-b784-e8296c92b8bc" name="[SF4.3.1] Select drone control mode"
                  description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The main processor shall select the AP mode as follows&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;colgroup width=&quot;204&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/colgroup>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;colgroup span=&quot;3&quot; width=&quot;207&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/colgroup>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;colgroup span=&quot;4&quot; width=&quot;245&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/colgroup>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;tbody>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Pilot control mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Manual override&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; colspan=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Mission completed&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Selected AP mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Selected control mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Validity status&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Validity status&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Value&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>OVERRIDE&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>VALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>MANUAL&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>N/A&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>INVALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>MANUAL&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Completed&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>MANUAL&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>N/A&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>INVALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;i>N/A&lt;/i>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>MANUAL&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>MANUAL&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>VALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;em>N/A&lt;/em>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>&lt;em>N/A&lt;/em>&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>N/A&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>MANUAL&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>VALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>NO OVERRIDE&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>VALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Not completed&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Speed consign mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>AUTO&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;tr>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; height=&quot;26&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Flight plan mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>VALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>NO OVERRIDE&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>VALID&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot;>Not completed&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>Flight plan mode&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none;&quot; valign=&quot;middle&quot;>AUTO&lt;/td>&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;/tr>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/tbody>&#xA;&lt;/table>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&lt;em>Note : in manual mode, the value of selected AP mode has no impact. The choice of setting AP mode to speed consign mode is justified so that an inadvertent transition of &amp;quot;Automatic control start&amp;quot; does not result on the execution of the programmed flight plan.&lt;/em>&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&lt;em>Note : in the current control strategy, the manual mode is considered as a &amp;quot;failsafe&amp;quot; mode when AUTO modes cannot be executed safely. Therefore, the invalidity of any input data for the mode selection leads to select the MANUAL mode. When all the input data are valid, &amp;quot;Manual override&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Mission completed&amp;quot; date have the priority to force the MANUAL mode. Therefore, to select an AUTO mode, all input must be valid, the manual override must not be selected and the mission not completed.&lt;/em>&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xA;">
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="019024ab-0749-4402-8e56-e5f4d9b4b468" name="FIP 2">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="fca07df7-4e7d-4a19-844f-a3058260bde9" targetElement="#1df38c10-7638-4038-ac73-2b625bfd7bc8"
                      sourceElement="#019024ab-0749-4402-8e56-e5f4d9b4b468"/>
                </inputs>
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="6159bee6-0499-4f94-a992-c177f0e432fd" name="FIP 6">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="80e5ef88-7642-4b60-b6f0-c7aa5d0a4c1a" targetElement="#3e57297a-47c1-4502-9c80-fa125a8a54c6"
                      sourceElement="#6159bee6-0499-4f94-a992-c177f0e432fd"/>
                </inputs>
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="0769de3b-481b-4c1c-acec-d55286cec641" name="FIP 1">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="58027dc0-f6e5-4976-b91a-7de981f49bd5" targetElement="#6d1d2161-7460-40a1-af2a-d44d18d1f22f"
                      sourceElement="#0769de3b-481b-4c1c-acec-d55286cec641"/>
                </inputs>
                <outputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionOutputPort"
                    id="58b604a1-5695-4f78-ae28-cf6391e4c5bd" name="FOP 2">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="b869fca3-b947-4e66-a8be-13936468faed" targetElement="#23fbdea1-0fb9-4a04-b27a-9c23aecfc08b"
                      sourceElement="#58b604a1-5695-4f78-ae28-cf6391e4c5bd"/>
                </outputs>
                <outputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionOutputPort"
                    id="264a6419-737a-4cc5-8b62-eae833cbcfcf" name="FOP 1">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="3219d52a-3764-4748-befa-f16f84a1324e" targetElement="#c64e770a-35b9-4854-b2b9-e1cc98bd5763"
                      sourceElement="#264a6419-737a-4cc5-8b62-eae833cbcfcf"/>
                </outputs>
                <ownedFunctionRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionRealization"
                    id="803c7d1c-347c-407d-b298-ca1e0e1221be" targetElement="#8d82e7cb-fb87-4d87-b99c-a48916dfd3b4"
                    sourceElement="#e027803f-5366-4da3-b784-e8296c92b8bc"/>
              </ownedFunctions>
              <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                  id="341a45c0-2bb4-4cf3-9fc4-cd23c908c056" name="[SF4.3.2] Passivate engagement oscillation"
                  description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The main processor shall detect oscillations of Selected control mode.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The main processor shall compute AP engagement as follows : IF (Selected control mode = MANUAL) OR (Selected control mode oscillations detected) THEN AP engagement = MANUAL ELSE AP engagement = AUTO.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The main processor shall compute Flight plan interruption as follows : IF (Selected control mode = MANUAL) OR (Selected control mode oscillations detected) THEN Flight plan interruption =&amp;nbsp;INTERRUPTED ELSE Flight plan interruption =&amp;nbsp;NOT INTERRUPTED.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="0ed49cf8-3a7c-4e59-b263-311e6023688f" name="FIP 1">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="7b740fc7-42b3-4233-807f-b96ca7211528" targetElement="#02065a3f-1b5e-47e0-a0d1-93fa37b59e6c"
                      sourceElement="#0ed49cf8-3a7c-4e59-b263-311e6023688f"/>
                </inputs>
                <outputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionOutputPort"
                    id="b837dedb-f9a2-4e43-ba27-28e84b9c725c" name="FOP 2">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="18b5f782-6580-4b10-875a-0b1fc1a593f0" targetElement="#362dfd7d-272a-4840-90b0-dee225898290"
                      sourceElement="#b837dedb-f9a2-4e43-ba27-28e84b9c725c"/>
                </outputs>
                <outputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionOutputPort"
                    id="7bc366a1-13c7-4549-bd74-ee6de13c42ce" name="FOP 1">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="7675c852-01f4-425a-a42f-fb5180e1b5cc" targetElement="#5712f34e-a884-42f4-b1b3-ece4d7f1f931"
                      sourceElement="#7bc366a1-13c7-4549-bd74-ee6de13c42ce"/>
                </outputs>
                <ownedFunctionRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionRealization"
                    id="3a3fccc0-6d5a-4d44-b195-344df1538df1" targetElement="#da49d77b-0072-4426-9ec7-6610838aef4c"
                    sourceElement="#341a45c0-2bb4-4cf3-9fc4-cd23c908c056"/>
              </ownedFunctions>
              <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                  id="7b3c2c7e-b973-4d75-b8e4-2503e770b1c7" name="[SF4.3.3] Indicate control mode"
                  description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The main processor shall compute the control mode for display as follows : IF AP engagement = MANUAL THEN control mode for display = manual mode ELSE control mode for display = Selected AP mode.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xA;">
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="bd896f35-2c90-4391-98a3-e01424e427a3" name="FIP 1">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="fd010d8b-8d5e-4c04-adf1-eab896d1abfb" targetElement="#16aa9d91-d707-4b47-9b36-250ea4879458"
                      sourceElement="#bd896f35-2c90-4391-98a3-e01424e427a3"/>
                </inputs>
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="3f0b7246-bfb0-4d22-b6d2-0d66d5c2ac62" name="FIP 2">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="c9484993-bb88-4c82-916f-755d98415c29" targetElement="#1ceb3f93-faad-4dde-acae-c0d5a07e439b"
                      sourceElement="#3f0b7246-bfb0-4d22-b6d2-0d66d5c2ac62"/>
                </inputs>
                <outputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionOutputPort"
                    id="1e4dfd75-224c-430b-abf6-c0a426de25c5" name="FOP 2">
                  <ownedPortRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.information:PortRealization"
                      id="e683ed90-5ff8-4f63-aae2-246202c6648a" targetElement="#d5cb01c0-2578-4077-b06e-1cd0d7b46b4c"
                      sourceElement="#1e4dfd75-224c-430b-abf6-c0a426de25c5"/>
                </outputs>
                <ownedFunctionRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionRealization"
                    id="fb13a0bf-965e-4f32-bc05-be69b9535940" targetElement="#9cce8f59-ea6b-4ef9-8b97-5c2c7faa85a5"
                    sourceElement="#7b3c2c7e-b973-4d75-b8e4-2503e770b1c7"/>
              </ownedFunctions>
              <ownedFunctionRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionRealization"
                  id="077d738f-4c70-4baa-88d3-fa012f57982a" targetElement="#d1263f11-3625-4876-a9e6-94080c255f92"
                  sourceElement="#cd31f598-995a-470d-936f-f7d2f2d8be3a"/>
              <ownedFunctionalExchanges xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionalExchange"
                  id="7fb52f54-e2dc-439a-8bc0-b6f1e02d25dd" name="Selected control mode"
                  description="&lt;p>This flow has three possible values :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>- Flight plan mode&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>- Speed consign mode&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>-Manual mode&lt;/p>&#xA;"
                  target="#0ed49cf8-3a7c-4e59-b263-311e6023688f" source="#58b604a1-5695-4f78-ae28-cf6391e4c5bd">
                <ownedFunctionalExchangeRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionalExchangeRealization"
                    id="e778148c-8727-446d-892d-b591497bb8a2" targetElement="#aca8421f-05d3-46d5-8882-d551ce7b18c9"
                    sourceElement="#7fb52f54-e2dc-439a-8bc0-b6f1e02d25dd"/>
              </ownedFunctionalExchanges>
              <ownedFunctionalExchanges xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionalExchange"
                  id="cb5e3af2-cd29-416d-86ff-6713d44f89ae" name="Selected AP mode"
                  target="#bd896f35-2c90-4391-98a3-e01424e427a3" source="#264a6419-737a-4cc5-8b62-eae833cbcfcf">
                <ownedFunctionalExchangeRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionalExchangeRealization"
                    id="5ed6a40a-5c0e-4ad7-82db-179db5a8ccce" targetElement="#c3e27061-690f-4dd0-bae3-ecb0009b56f7"
                    sourceElement="#cb5e3af2-cd29-416d-86ff-6713d44f89ae"/>
              </ownedFunctionalExchanges>
              <ownedFunctionalExchanges xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionalExchange"
                  id="7a50efbc-10c3-4446-9735-aa887cc02547" name="AP engagement" target="#3f0b7246-bfb0-4d22-b6d2-0d66d5c2ac62"
                  source="#b837dedb-f9a2-4e43-ba27-28e84b9c725c">
                <ownedFunctionalExchangeRealizations xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionalExchangeRealization"
                    id="452fce94-a21f-4de2-b30f-0a1e1d39070b" targetElement="#a8be24ef-4527-46b9-9e89-ca4628c640b0"
                    sourceElement="#7a50efbc-10c3-4446-9735-aa887cc02547"/>
              </ownedFunctionalExchanges>
            </ownedFunctions>
            <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                id="731ee7ee-6b79-40c9-ace1-b20d81337f68" name="[SF4.4] Acquire pilot control consigns and mode"
                description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The control desk shall acquire the following pilot control consigns : automatic control start, pilot control consigns, pilote control mode.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The control desk shall send the automatic control start, pilot control consigns and&amp;nbsp;pilot control mode&amp;nbsp;to the drone, along with the associated validity statuses.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
