                  description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The inertial reference sensors MON&amp;nbsp;shall measure the&amp;nbsp;linear acceleration along X, Y and Z axis, and provide an associated&amp;nbsp;validity status.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
