              <ownedFunctions xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.pa:PhysicalFunction"
                  id="d51abd0b-592b-48fb-8123-a08be8280e75" name="[SF7.2.4] Control pitch angle MON"
                  description="&lt;p>REQ :&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The monitoring processor shall compute Ptheta as the result of the closed loop control of the pitch angle to reach the Pitch consign MON&amp;nbsp;from the current Drone pitch and Drone pitch rate measurement.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p>The monitoring processor shall compute the Ptheta validity status as follow : IF (Drone pitchis INVALID) OR (Drone pitch rate validity status&amp;nbsp;is INVALID) OR (Pitch consign validity status&amp;nbsp;is INVALID)&amp;nbsp;THEN Ptheta validity status is INVALID ELSE Ptheta validity status is VALID&lt;/p>&#xA;">
                <inputs xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:FunctionInputPort"
                    id="bf662635-c479-48c7-a4ce-0db9a5c175cc" name="FIP PC">
